        "reported_material_gaps": [],
        "research_rationale": "EO 12429 (signed 1983-06-28; 48 FR 30087) was read in full in the held Federal Register text jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12429.txt. It restates section 4(b) of Executive Order 12369 with the termination date 1983-10-30, unless sooner extended. The dossier evidence ACT:EO:12429>EO:12553 (agent-located, independently reviewed) was re-read against the held EO 12553 text, whose revocation table lists 12429. EO 12447 (1983-10-27) and EO 12455 (1983-12-29) restate the same sentence with later dates, and EO 12534 (1985-09-30) revokes the parent EO 12369 without naming EO 12429. Machine searches read: U.S. Code 0 hits, eCFR 0 hits, Federal Register catalog 2 hits. Under the owner rulings of 2026-10-21 and 2026-10-28 the end is EO 12553 with the later sunset amendments and the parent revocation disclosed.\nMember checks: {\"earlier_end_check\":\"Candidates tested for an earlier end: the sunset date 1983-10-30 was superseded by EO 12447 (1983-12-31) and EO 12455 (1984-01-31, unless sooner extended), so it is not an end; no held source shows whether the Committee was extended after 1984-01-31 or when it ceased. EO 12534 revokes the parent EO 12369 effective 1985-09-30 but does not name EO 12429; disclosed, not adopted. Only EO 12553 names EO 12429.\",\"independent_command_check\":\"The single operative command is the restated termination sentence; the recital of purpose (to extend the life of the Survey) is not a separate command.\",\"savings_check\":\"Read for savings: EO 12553 has no savings clause in its enacting sentence. Accrued effect: existence of the Committee through the periods the sentence covered.\",\"scope_check\":\"The whole order is one amendment of section 4(b) of EO 12369. EO 12447 and EO 12455 are later rewrites of the same sentence (later events whose substance is the date); EO 12553 revokes the whole order.\"}",
